;    1: TDecorate(count=298, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=141, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=おきて, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=12, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=おきて, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ひん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=1708, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=1565, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>We left the child with my mother-in-law, and the two of us talked about the Green-Eye Curse-Killing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Never before had such tension run between <STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE> and me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kikyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, was that in the storehouse's books?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE> asked.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes. A number of alarming things were written there..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
Just as I thought, <STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE> knew something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He raised his head, and his eyes wandered as though his gaze were writing out the words, Where should I even begin?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE> sighed once.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kikyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I want you to tell me how much you know. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">We've only heard about it by word of mouth. We've never checked it in the storehouse's books."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Understood."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, we both straightened up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The tension in the room rose even further.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"That a girl born with green eyes is to be killed at once. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That's what was written in that book. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Apparently it's because she could become a threat to the very existence of the settlement."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I know about that too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">A child born with green eyes is killed right away―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">since I was born, it's happened only once. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But I don't know why they're killed."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Because of </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="おきて">the law</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
Because it is <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="おきて">the law</STYLE>, a newborn baby is killed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What a cruel <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="おきて">law</STYLE> that is, an ordinary person would think.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I see it the other way around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4" RUBY="おきて">The law</STYLE> is not there to bind people.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is to protect people that <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="おきて">the law</STYLE> exists.<PG>
If that child had simply grown up―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
this settlement might have been struck by a calamity like those of the past.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The events of the past are as follows.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "山火事.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
About 340 years ago: March, Shiyo 340―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was internal strife in this settlement, it is said.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Many people whose eyes had turned green appeared, killing the residents one after another.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The settlement's population fell to nearly half.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They went on killing one another until none of the green-eyed were left.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if they had been cursed by the green eyes.<PG>
When the green-eyed were down to the last one, the internal strife finally came to an end.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That last one was a girl not yet old enough to speak. Her name was Tomi.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The residents feared that Tomi, too, would bring about killings.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But in the end they reached no conclusion on what to do, and 12 years went by.<PG>
12 years later, in Shiyo 352, Tomi suddenly fell into a frenzy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But as if resisting that frenzy, Tomi gouged out her eyes with her bare hands and took her own life.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The residents decided to enshrine Tomi, who had resisted the curse, as a great goddess.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That is the Verde mummy.<PG>
Then 130 years passed, and it was Shiyo 482.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were records of 'the Goddess' and 'the Fierce Sound.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After the Goddess appeared, several of the residents disappeared.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Soon after, 'cherry trees of unnatural size' covered the mountains, and the settlement was brought to the <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ひん">brink</STYLE> of destruction.<PG>
But somehow they drove the Goddess off, and the destruction of the settlement was averted, it seems.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
However, it is said that the young Grand Witch of that time lost her life because of it.<PG>
After this, the settlement came to ban the use of Droga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But some people simply could not accept the ban on Droga.<PG>
And they took all the remaining Droga and left the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They went south from the Arata settlement, toward Megasawa, it is said.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thus the Arata settlement split in two, and Droga was no longer used in the settlement.<PG>
But more than 100 years have passed again since then, the ban of those days has faded, and now Droga is being used once more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, why would the giant cherry trees and the thing called the Goddess have led to a ban on Droga?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whether they are connected to the residents' disappearances as well, I cannot yet tell.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Are these merely legends, or...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n798\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, do any legends like that sound familiar to you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Tomi, giant cherry trees... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Sorry, but I've never heard of them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And as for the people who left Arata, rumor has it they founded a religion somewhere around Megasawa, but I don't know any more than that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But I do remember residents disappearing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You remember?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. It happened only about 10 years ago."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------